  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#constructing-form-data-set:the-input-element-7\n\n>  If there are no selected files, then append an entry to the form data set with the name as the name, the empty string as the value, and application/octet-stream as the type.\n\nThis is not clear to me: there is not a setter where we can pass name+string+type.\nDoes it mean that we must create a blob with such type and empty value and store it?\nWhat should 'get(name)' return? a Blob? if yes, when is it created?\n\nWhat I propose is this:\n\nIf there are no selected files, then create a new File object with 'name' as name, an empty string as value and 'application/octet-stream' as the type. Then append an entry to the form data with the name as the name, and the new File as value.\n",
